  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-copycat-shadow-v2-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "2a156cf14a013cfe4719f5234aa7835ec6225a5caf4268eb3d3d6610af0875f2",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ccd64509fa0651ffa6b416d0ae7f0ca277c309c6c9d696a5fa103d8af1bf2112",
      "text": "悟空的跟屁虫影子",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8dbc922a68f6976c9d7faafcb0633e13efd56c7787f733451ba98605c82d3710",
      "text": "今晚，院子里\n要演影子戏。\n沙僧在这边放一盏灯，\n在那边立一块白幕布：\n“灯和幕布都不挪动。”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5075a943152e45c075cffdba028383558283aaf4b50a2211bfef8038710bff3",
      "text": "悟空走到\n灯和幕布中间，\n甩了甩尾巴——\n幕布上也甩起一条\n大大的尾巴！\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cc40533cfbf5079381ac626d1b0336e78f56da083ae52dbeb30955eecf788547",
      "text": "悟空问：“那是谁？”\n他挥挥手，它也挥挥手；\n他跳一跳，它也跳一跳。\n“有人在学我！”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "192f3e699db6a0df4fb61c1bb4bff08447d74c9bc42bed625de7bef71e071e45",
      "text": "玉兔咯咯地笑：\n“那是你的影子呀。\n你把光挡住了，\n幕布上就留下\n一个黑黑的影子。”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "47c4de99bc8af90c1180d23f6ba3bb1303c414a15ae612d8ebe23b2650f4e502",
      "text": "玉兔举起\n一根小棍上的纸猴子：\n“你们看。”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fece052feecaab8a3bf4901729f17b189762273f09f44d247f99ba2c4dcee13a",
      "text": "她把纸猴子\n往灯那边移近一点，\n影子变得\n越来越大！\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "372b1a5351acc26f7d05e0ef43ad90b5d8bfb80f7b5ced791bfbe1f0e2aef066",
      "text": "她再把纸猴子移得离灯远一点，\n靠近幕布，\n影子就变小了。\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f90b676cee8420a4b58e6c6d2628f37c2b02b0aa08d5d767e7fb84a423578229",
      "text": "悟空拿起纸兔子试一试：\n靠近灯，变成大兔子！\n离得远，变成小兔子！\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fdbe8baebc955107b372ced2789c5ec7fbff514aed2fa0aa6f8a6d9a6a04c071",
      "text": "大大的猴子影子\n遇到了小小的兔子影子。\n悟空说：“小兔子，你先走。”\n大猴子影子\n还鞠了一个躬。\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "660f0c2c9745a55f3dd0dc0be6a9f5cf136015850abeee46d3128355ae322d3e",
      "text": "八戒坐到软垫上，\n高兴地喊：“开演啦！”\n沙僧在灯旁边挥挥手。\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c623f860842b33171a83ca1d2dca74d303f77e216f7cecebee602db2a067d264",
      "text": "幕布上冒出\n两只长长的耳朵。\n玉兔问：\n“这是谁的耳朵呀？”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9322fa895f787efc342ee26118687017106423e9fa4790a20288e3f572fca300",
      "text": "八戒说：“是玉兔的！”\n接着又冒出两只耳朵，\n比刚才还要高。\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7c0590df016db7230692188178662b651f6b5844a339f2032915e894a8fed3bf",
      "text": "八戒哈哈大笑：\n“那才不是耳朵，\n是悟空的两根手指！”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f6bae9e66ee1865d807185a8a89612e4b1fdd518400ca40ad99384c7444c609b",
      "text": "悟空和玉兔\n藏到幕布后面，\n两个影子一起\n挥手说再见。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fdf316b495e96cc81ea5e7e02e9a50c500994feb4fb4e7c90c5f92965fc3e245",
      "text": "沙僧关上灯，\n影子都不见了。\n悟空说：“学我的朋友回家啦。”\n“灯一亮，\n他就会回来！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
